# Site build artifacts (generated by `generator/site` on every deploy).
# llms.txt is committed (small, stable, repo-browsable for AI agents who
# crawl the GitHub repo rather than the deployed Pages site);
# commands.json and llms-full.txt regenerate from the binary on every
# build and would otherwise add multi-thousand-line diffs to every PR.
docs/site/commands.json
docs/site/llms-full.txt

